{
 "about": "The overview from the keyboard with the screen reader on in Spanish (docs/adr/0039-keyboard-access.mdx): Allo (sample/EditingProbe.tsx) with the shell. Super+F3 and → reach the dock's overview button, Space opens the overview on its first control; each window is one button named by its title, as Mission Control's window is one element (not a title and a card doing the same), its close button the next stop; the backdrop that closes it is no stop; Space on the window goes to it. At 1.25 (1600 × 1000).",
 "locale": "es_ES.UTF-8",
 "module": "EditingProbe",
 "window": [
  600,
  360
 ],
 "shell": "OxyOSShell",
 "app": {
  "id": "so.oxy.allo",
  "title": "Allo"
 },
 "reader": {},
 "outputs": "1600x1000@1.25",
 "steps": [
  {
   "name": "Allo's window; the reader on",
   "do": [
    "wait",
    1500
   ],
   "allow_unchanged": true,
   "expect": {
    "keyboard_focus": null,
    "spoken": [],
    "announcements": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "Super+F3 puts the keyboard on the dock's first icon",
   "do": [
    "key",
    [
     125,
     61
    ]
   ],
   "allow_unchanged": true,
   "expect": {
    "react": {},
    "in_shell": {
     "keyboard_focus": {
      "target": "dock-launcher",
      "ring": true
     }
    },
    "spoken": [
     {
      "text": "Abrir aplicaciones, botón",
      "interrupting": true
     }
    ],
    "announcements": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "→ the overview's button",
   "do": [
    "key",
    [
     106
    ]
   ],
   "allow_unchanged": true,
   "expect": {
    "react": {},
    "in_shell": {
     "keyboard_focus": {
      "target": "dock-overview",
      "ring": true
     }
    },
    "spoken": [
     {
      "text": "Ver escritorios, botón",
      "interrupting": true
     }
    ],
    "announcements": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "Space opens the overview, which takes the keyboard on its first control, the desktop (its backdrop is no stop); Allo's window is one button, named by its title",
